{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/16/7147990/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/16/7147990/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隙間時間を見つけて\nみんなで談笑している時間が\n毎日とっても楽しい◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にこにこ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"----------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2/23発売のBRODYさんに\n載っています〜！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はずっと出たかったBRODYさん。\n今回出れて凄い嬉しい...♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影の時少し緊張しちゃったんだけど\nこの嬉しさが届いてたらいいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今回は色についての撮影！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれに合う色を\n衣装さんに選んでいただきました◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はどの色でしょう〜？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/16/7147990/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たる方いるかな〜( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・2/18 FLASHスペシャル グラビアBESTさん\n・2/24 Samurai ELOさん\n・発売中 月刊エンタメさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらも是非♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"----------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「星に願いを」flumpoolさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世界観や雰囲気が大好き。\n美しくて儚くて、でも強い。\nそこが好き！\n\"いつか君と 夜空のふたつ星に\n名前つけて 交わした指切り\"\nロマンチックで素敵〜\n星に名前つけて交わした約束って\n一体何だろう。\n2人の将来かな、それとも個人の夢かな。\nそうやって色々と考えるのも楽しい。\n歌ってやっぱりいいな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お家帰ったら、お母さんが\nクッキーを焼いていてくれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしたの？って聞いたら\nバレンタインの時沢山あったお菓子が\n全部無くなっちゃって寂しかったからって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんの少し可愛い部分でした。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}